<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>RPS Game</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style/style.css">

    <!-- fonts -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Teko:wght@300..700&family=VT323&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <!-- fonts -->

    <script src="https://ajax.googleapis.com/ajax/libs/jquery/3.7.1/jquery.min.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

    <h1 class="heading gp">GAME POINTS</h1>
    <ul class="container-flex">
        <li class="points-number" onclick="window.location.href=`/game`" data-name="1">1</li>
        <li class="points-number" onclick="window.location.href=`/game`" data-name="2">3</li>
        <li class="points-number" onclick="window.location.href=`/game`" data-name="3">5</li>
    </ul>
    
    <div class="game-info" id="gameInfo">
        <p>
            Rock-Paper-Scissors is a simple game where two players choose one of three hand signs—  
            Rock (✊), Paper (✋), or Scissors (✌️)—and reveal them at the same time.  
            The winner is determined by the rules:  
            Rock crushes Scissors, Scissors cut Paper, and Paper covers Rock.  
            If both players choose the same sign, it's a tie.
        </p>
    </div>

    <button class="btn htp">HOW TO PLAY</button>

    <script src="/index.js" charset="UTF-8"></script>

</body>
</html>